&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Native-level German proficiency is required for this role. Candidates must be able to lead customer workshops, conduct executive presentations, and manage stakeholder interactions in German.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
